  "details": "Accessories don't match up between me and my friend.\n\nHe wore the Summer hat and the arm swim puff. I could only see the arm puff, and when he tried an older look I could see the older default accessories. But we could not get the hat visible. \n\nHe could also not see the wings and collars I had enabled on the avatar. But he could see me using the arm puff when I attached it.\n\nI had my client running for both the new items being added to the store and for the item drop to arrive. Same for him I think.\n\nThis is my log: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1gyoMoEOuyJ5l36yJ2AAXJ6A7GalmK2Ee/view?usp=drive_link",
